    "title": "Always Watch the Eyes: Video Shows DSA Co-Chair Fall Apart When Asked Exactly Who She Wants to Tax More",
    "text": "Democratic Socialists of America co-chair Megan Romer had no answer when pressed on whom she would tax more and at what rate to pay for her party’s multi-trillion-dollar agenda.\nThe best Romer could come up with during an interview with David Remnick of The New Yorker Radio Hour podcast , posted Aug. 7, was that her plan involved “taxing the hell out of millionaires.”\n“What does ‘taxing the hell out of them’ mean?” Remnick wondered.",
